{
    "title": "Learn Guitar - Real Tabs",
    "description": "<b>\ud83c\udfb8 Introducing Real guitar: Your perfect strumming partner \ud83d\udca5</b>\r\nUnlock your musical potential with the Learn guitar - Real guitar simulator app! This simply guitar is designed to help you master the piano whether you're beginners or advanced guitarists. Real guitar - tabs and chords app provides a fun and engaging way to learn guitar and play guitar.\r\n\r\nDive in to learn guitar and play guitar with sheet music, tabs and chords, and music notes. Learn guitar - Real guitar simulator app offers dozens of options and playing modes to play guitar. Never get bored!\r\n\r\nWith high-quality sound recording, it's like a professional garageband is right next to you! Simply guitar - Real guitar simulator\u2019s user-friendly interface helps create fantastic songs like never before. \r\n\r\nNo prior experience needed | Suitable for all ages | Compatible with any guitar\r\n--- Make Your Musical Dreams Come True \u2014\r\n\r\n<b>\ud83c\udf1f So what\u2019s inside Simply guitar - Tabs and chords?\r\n<b>\ud83c\udfb8Real guitar simulator and musical instrument to suit any style</b>: \r\nAcoustic guitars, electric guitars and classic guitar. Learn guitar - Real guitar simulator provides everything you need to master playing the guitar on your phone or tablet. Effortlessly learn guitar and play guitar anywhere!\r\n\r\n<b>\ud83c\udf3b Awesome playing options to learn guitar and play guitar with Simply guitar - Tabs and chords:</b>\r\n\ud83e\ude90Solo mode to create beautiful solos\r\n\ud83e\ude90Chord mode to practice strumming patterns\r\n\ud83e\ude90Hand switcher for both right-handed and left-handed guitarists. \r\n\ud83e\ude90Just like playing real guitar, you can easily enjoy strum pattern, fingerstyle, arpeggios, riffs, strike, etc.\r\n\r\n<b>\ud83c\udfbc Tabs and chords for a variety of songs:</b>\r\n\ud83c\udfb5 Complete library book with playback function\r\n\ud83c\udfb5 Quickly find guitar chords on the fingerboard and learn scales on the fretboard\r\n\ud83c\udfb5 Songbook with sheet music \r\n\ud83c\udfb5 Read and play tabs\r\n\ud83c\udfb5 Playing chords\r\n\ud83c\udfb5 Chord switching\r\n\ud83c\udfb5 Step-by-step video lessons\r\n\r\n<b>\ud83c\udf08Multiple instrument music playground:</b>\r\nDrum for a drummer\r\nPiano for be a pianist\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfb6 Who can use Learn guitar - Real guitar simulator: Anyone with a love for MUSIC!\r\n\r\nWhether you're aiming to be the next guitar legend or just seeking a fun music game to enjoy with friends, Learn Guitar - Real Guitar Simulator has you covered! Plus, with Simply guitar, you\u2019ll never have to worry about changing the string! \ud83c\udfb8</b>",
